
================================================================================
 EXPERIMENT 2: LAN-A (3 HOSTS CONNECTED VIA A LAYER-1 HUB)
================================================================================
[Step 1] Network IP Topology (LAN-A: 192.168.10.0/24):
  - Host-A1: 192.168.10.1 (Connected to Hub-A Fa0)
  - Host-A2: 192.168.10.2 (Connected to Hub-A Fa1)
  - Host-A3: 192.168.10.3 (Connected to Hub-A Fa2)

