[Step 5] Hub-A Layer-1 Statistics:
  - Total bits/frames repeated unconditionally: 30
  - Collision Domain Count: 1 (Shared across all 3 ports)
  - Broadcast Domain Count: 1

[Observation & Conclusion]:
  - Hub acts as a Layer-1 repeater: bits received on any port are echoed to all other ports.
  - All stations receive all traffic; filtering occurs only at Layer 2 inside host NICs.
  - All pairs demonstrated 100% ICMP reachability.
